{"before_validation callback in EmbeddableHost calls sub! on self.host without handling nil, which will raise if a record is instantiated without a host": 0.9244610667228699, "update and destroy methods in embeddable_hosts_controller call methods on host without handling the case where no EmbeddableHost is found for the given id (host is nil), which will raise an exception": 0.9079484343528748, "record_for_host compares lower(host) in SQL against raw URI#host without downcasing, so URLs with uppercase characters may fail the lookup": 0.8015276193618774, "Migration INSERT statement interpolates host value directly into SQL without parameterization or escaping, risking issues with malformed values like apostrophes": 0.804670512676239, "Migration SELECT calls index [0] without checking for rows, which will raise if those settings are missing during deployment": 0.9446710348129272, "host.save(props) in embeddable-host.js.es6 passes props as argument but Ember Data ignores positional arguments to save, so category_id may not be persisted": 0.40580353140830994, "Missing tests for TopicEmbed.import when no matching embeddable host exists to exercise the eh.try(:category_id) fallback": 0.035408712923526764, "Missing tests for record_for_host edge cases including invalid URL input, nil/empty string inputs, and case-insensitive matching": 0.04842096194624901, "Missing controller specs for Admin::EmbeddingController show/update responses and embeddable hosts ordering": 0.02885846234858036, "Plural embedded hydration in store.js.es6 calls obj[k].map without checking that obj[k] is an array, so malformed payloads will throw": 0.37519368529319763, "Plural embedded hydration assigns hydrated array directly without filtering out null/undefined entries from failed _lookupSubType calls": 0.5976872444152832, "ADMIN_MODELS.indexOf(type.replace('_', '-')) only replaces the first underscore, which may behave unexpectedly for admin models with multiple underscores": 0.7357796430587769}